---
import ContactSection from '../components/ContactSection.astro';
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
	title="About"
	description="Emet Labs is a research and engineering company building verification infrastructure for AI agents."
	footerEmail={false}
>
	<header class="wrap pt-14 pb-14 sm:pt-20 sm:pb-20 lg:pt-24">
		<p class="meta text-dusk">About Emet Labs</p>
		<h1 class="mt-6 max-w-5xl text-hero text-ink">
			A mistaken answer can be ignored. <span class="quiet">A mistaken payment&nbsp;cannot.</span>
		</h1>
	</header>

	<div class="wrap grid gap-12 pb-12 sm:pb-16 lg:grid-cols-12 lg:gap-8">
		<div class="measure text-lede text-slate lg:order-last lg:col-span-6 lg:col-start-4">
			<p>
				Emet Labs is a research and engineering company building verification infrastructure for AI
				agents.
			</p>
			<p class="mt-6">
				As agents start to take actions with consequences, the people responsible for them need a record
				they can check. We think that record belongs in the infrastructure, not in the agent’s own
				account.
			</p>
		</div>

		<dl class="grid gap-6 text-small sm:grid-cols-2 lg:col-span-3 lg:grid-cols-1 ticks border border-line p-6 lg:border-x-0 lg:border-b-0 lg:bg-none lg:px-0">
			<div>
				<dt class="meta text-dusk">Work</dt>
				<dd class="mt-1 text-ink">
					<a href="/sentinel/" class="link">Sentinel</a>, <a href="/research/" class="link">research</a>{' '}
					and <a href="/trace-grab/" class="link">trace-grab</a>
				</dd>
			</div>
			<div>
				<dt class="meta text-dusk">Open source</dt>
				<dd class="mt-1 text-slate">Code that runs inside your systems: trace-grab and our instrumentation SDKs.</dd>
			</div>
			<div>
				<dt class="meta text-dusk">Careers</dt>
				<dd class="mt-1 text-ink"><a href="/careers/" class="link">No open positions right now</a></dd>
			</div>
		</dl>
	</div>

	<ContactSection lead="Engineers, researchers, teams deploying agents:" follow="we are glad to talk." channels />
</BaseLayout>
